<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/cursor') %>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="story-hero">
    <div class="story-hero-img-wrap">
      <img src="/images/edinburgh.jpg" alt="Edinburgh" class="story-hero-img" style="opacity: 0.7;">
      <div class="story-hero-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-hero-content reveal">
      <span class="story-hero-category">Business</span>
      <h1 class="story-hero-title">Braxton Studios Named a Trusted LS Productions Supplier</h1>
      <span class="story-hero-date">September 25, 2026</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article -->
  <section class="story-body">
    <div class="story-body-inner reveal">
      <p>Braxton Studios has been accepted into <a href="https://lsproductions.com/" target="_blank" class="story-link">LS Productions'</a> database of trusted suppliers, opening the door to provide video production and YouTube strategy services across LS Productions' network of clients and projects.</p>

      <p>Working directly within one of Scotland's most esteemed production companies' workflows has already given the studio a sharper, ground-level view of the practical challenges within the creator protocol: the process by which creator-led content is vetted, resourced, and delivered to a professional standard. It's reinforced something Braxton Studios has argued from the start: cinematic production and creator-first thinking aren't at odds with one another, they're strongest when combined.</p>

      <div class="story-inline-img" style="max-width: 300px;">
        <img src="/images/edinburgh ii.jpg" alt="Braxton Studios on set">
      </div>

      <p>Alongside this, the studio is also currently testing a new AdSense revenue-split system, designed to automatically divide ad revenue between production stakeholders and creators on shared projects, an early step toward making multi-party YouTube projects easier to manage and pay out fairly.</p>

      <p>Being named a trusted supplier connects Braxton Studios to a wider network of production partners and clients, another step in the studio's move from creative studio to scalable production business.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/signup') %>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
